# Changelog

All notable changes to this skill are documented here.

## [1.1.0] - 2026-08-19

### Changed
- Output format changed from Google Docs to a Word document (`.docx`), since Claude cannot create Google Docs output directly.
- Removed the requirement to save into a specific Google Drive folder ("Company Briefings"), since not all users have Google Drive connected or want to grant Claude access to it.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-08-19

### Added
- Initial public release of the skill, converted from personal prompt notes into shareable markdown.
- Replaced hardcoded personal details ("FSR at Google Cloud") with reusable placeholders: `<current job title>` and `<current employer>`.
- Documented mandatory sections: Company Overview, Competitive Landscape, Risks to Their Business, Questions to Ask, Questions to Expect, Additional Resources.
